From 8defcefa947645d2245a320dc2d0e0c2eb8ce6cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: satoru akita <wwlap24@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:42:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] net: add a runtime-configured WireGuard virtual network
 device

Queue immutable outbound datagrams for worker-owned socket sends outside the device lock. Add the pointer-free ioctl interface, lifecycle recovery, realtime handshake timestamps, build wiring, and documentation. Require IOB chain heads and keep the vendored apps X25519 adaptation excluded from nxstyle.
